      "post_title": "Maqwi Itar",
      "post_name": "maqwi-itar",
      "post_content": "<h2>Maqwi Itar</h2><p>Maqwi Itar comes in a compact 12 ml bottle for everyday personal fragrance.</p><h3>Your bottle</h3><p>Net volume: <strong>12 ml</strong>. Price: <strong>PKR 200</strong>. Scent and ingredient information will be available before ordering opens.</p><h3>Use with care</h3><p>For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes and broken skin. Stop use if irritation occurs. Keep the bottle closed, away from heat and out of reach of children. Follow the supplied product label.</p>",
      "post_excerpt": "Personal fragrance in a compact 12 ml bottle. PKR 200 per bottle.",
      "post_type": "product",
      "post_status": "publish",
      "menu_order": "0"
