      "ID": "26",
      "post_parent": "0",
      "post_title": "Maqwi Honey",
      "post_name": "maqwi-honey",
      "post_content": "<h2>Maqwi Honey</h2><p>Bring Maqwi Honey to the table with warm toast, yoghurt, fruit or your favourite breakfast bowl. Stir a spoonful into a drink or use it as a sweet finishing touch in everyday recipes.</p><h3>Your pack</h3><p>Net weight: <strong>1 kg</strong>. Price: <strong>PKR 4,500</strong>. The gallery illustrates the brand packaging in a 500 g jar; it does not show the size of the 1 kg pack.</p><h3>Serving and care</h3><p>Use a clean, dry spoon and close the lid after use. Honey is not suitable for infants under 12 months. Check the supplied label for batch, best-before and storage instructions.</p>",
      "post_excerpt": "A spoonful of sweetness for breakfast, drinks and everyday recipes. Net weight: 1 kg.",
      "post_type": "product",
      "post_status": "publish",
      "menu_order": "0"
