      "post_title": "Maqwi Desi Ghee",
      "post_name": "maqwi-desi-ghee",
      "post_content": "<h2>Maqwi Desi Ghee</h2><p>Add Maqwi Desi Ghee while cooking or use a small spoonful to finish warm roti, rice or dal. A practical choice for the everyday dishes you enjoy sharing at home.</p><h3>Your pack</h3><p>Net weight: <strong>1 kg</strong>. Price: <strong>PKR 3,500</strong>. This product is sold by weight. The pictured jar is marked 500 ml. This listing is for 1 kg by weight.</p><h3>Serving and care</h3><p>Use a clean, dry utensil and keep the container closed between uses. Ghee is a dairy product. Check the supplied label for the final ingredient, allergen and storage information.</p>",
      "post_excerpt": "A familiar addition to roti, rice, dal and home cooking. Sold by net weight: 1 kg.",
