      "post_title": "Our Story",
      "post_name": "about",
      "post_content": "<!-- wp:html --><p class=\"mq-eyebrow\">Maqwi Organics \u00b7 Pakistan</p><h2>Welcome to Maqwi</h2><p>Maqwi Organics is a Pakistan-based brand bringing together honey, desi ghee, achaar and itar.</p><p>Our range covers everyday cooking, the breakfast table and personal fragrance. Browse each product for its pack size, price and care information.</p><p><a href=\"/shop/\">Explore the collection \u2192</a></p><!-- /wp:html -->",
      "post_excerpt": "",
      "post_type": "page",
      "post_status": "publish",
      "menu_order": "0"
    },
    {
      "ID": "39",
      "post_parent": "0",
      "post_title": "Contact",
      "post_name": "contact",
      "post_content": "<!-- wp:html --><h2>Get in touch</h2><p>Customer support contact details will be available here when ordering opens.</p><p>For now, visit our frequently asked questions for information about the collection and availability.</p><p><a href=\"/faq/\">Frequently asked questions \u2192</a></p><!-- /wp:html -->",
