    {
      "ID": "40",
      "post_parent": "0",
      "post_title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "post_name": "faq",
      "post_content": "<!-- wp:html --><details><summary>Can I place an order?</summary><p>Ordering opens soon. You can browse the collection and product details now.</p></details><details><summary>What are the prices and pack sizes?</summary><p>Maqwi Honey is PKR 4,500 for 1 kg. Desi Ghee is PKR 3,500 for 1 kg. Itar is PKR 200 for 12 ml. Achaar is coming soon.</p></details><details><summary>Why does the pictured pack show a different size?</summary><p>Some images show a different pack size. The net weight or volume stated on the product listing applies to your selected pack.</p></details><details><summary>Where do you deliver?</summary><p>Delivery areas, charges and estimated timings for Pakistan will be published when ordering opens.</p></details><details><summary>Which payment methods can I use?</summary><p>Available payment methods will be listed when ordering opens. Payments are currently unavailable.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I find ingredient and allergen information?</summary><p>Read the product details and the supplied label before use. Do not assume a product is allergen-free.</p></details><details><summary>What is your returns policy?</summary><p>Return and cancellation terms will be available on our Returns page before orders open.</p></details><p><a href=\"/shop/\">Browse products \u2192</a></p><!-- /wp:html -->",
